# HELM Core

> {{ site.description | safe }}

HELM Core is an MIT-licensed C# script for Space Engineers Programmable Blocks.
Configure screens with the HELM text DSL in Custom Data; no game mod is required.
This site documents version {{ site.versionLabel }} in English.
HELM Core is an independent project and is not affiliated with Keen Software House.

